			"notes": "This release:\n- Adds a keybind to toggle the mod on/off (unbound by default)\n- Adds a config to turn the mod on/off, turn confirmation on/off, and select where the confirmation message is sent (Chat/HUD)\n- Adds a proper logo for the mod\n- Makes all text strings translatable, though only `en_US` is available right now.\n- Fixes that the mod only worked in Survival/Adventure, and allows it to work in Creative as well\n\nIf you are on 1.20.4, please download the version labeled MC_1.20.4. The other file will work on 1.20.5-1.21.4."
